{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":14336.878702,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":14728.812219,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":14782.203384999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14783.75644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14785.194522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14786.964001999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":14788.746331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14790.387798999998,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":14902.092411,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":15113.227873999998,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":15152.663610000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15154.302914000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":15154.630316,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":21021.520141,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21318.466598,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21363.303573999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21365.10338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21366.760150000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21368.519305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":21368.822451,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33794.301091,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34092.550167,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34138.663712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34140.326192,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34142.033218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":34143.786193,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34145.545628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34146.415226,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":44860.281828,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45334.650805,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45388.962665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45390.716172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45392.543278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45394.34029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45396.24303,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45398.12493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45400.091786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45402.039984999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45404.269958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45404.597149,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51585.499467,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":51849.341996999996,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":51892.23414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51893.927485,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51895.694051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51897.394538,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51898.772318999996,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62256.878235,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62520.971643,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62562.792003999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62564.443987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62566.202981999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62566.357584,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62606.880894999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62608.449562999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62610.182879,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62610.337432,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73306.320859,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larsson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":73728.18386100001,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larsson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":73774.5795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73776.201959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":73777.950658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73779.71931700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73781.52388000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73782.98078000001,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":77711.19780200001,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77907.80606500001,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77949.85504000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77951.417189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77952.92847,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":87204.826128,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":87395.270845,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":87436.81020400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":87438.73358500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87440.289244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":87440.37955000001,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91079.89460900001,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91197.123506,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":91237.16998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91238.330675,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":91238.464837,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96631.446737,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":96889.33268200001,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":96932.23112400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96933.894104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96935.649694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96937.511052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":96937.61014100001,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101422.91195200001,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101646.854878,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101690.376478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101691.711314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101693.505862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101694.83533100001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":107135.013034,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":107382.818033,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":107427.692095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107429.20693300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107431.00785000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107432.812063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":107432.926204,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116103.816439,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116453.43402,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116500.05380600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116501.678018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116503.33152400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116505.17146000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116506.94747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":116507.20330400001,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126854.508553,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127228.716833,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127280.232069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127282.28665800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127283.81234100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127285.52874200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127287.313334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127289.157206,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127291.059687,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":127291.17435900001,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137867.422722,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138214.21938199998,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138257.129701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138258.668625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138259.586335,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138286.568518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138288.243146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138290.123122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138291.893043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138293.130273,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138328.200166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138328.74951199998,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":148974.502855,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":149382.111678,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":149436.7903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149438.330545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149439.981417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149441.77288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":149443.613117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":149445.392582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149447.10731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149448.939484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149450.17781599998,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":151479.787108,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151588.03944999998,"text":"imported to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151630.133212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151630.55653899998,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":158692.211434,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":158953.887688,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":158999.298006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159000.796018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":159002.34280299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159004.152844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159005.339598,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167126.270917,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":167430.34973699998,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":167473.848952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":167475.458922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167476.190111,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"audio","t":167511.973547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167513.744259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167515.384895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167516.17661599998,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":179196.268542,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179573.539506,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179626.176829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179627.59419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179629.313615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179631.13968999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179632.824142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179634.593041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179636.35007299998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179636.941722,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":188409.113185,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":188703.674646,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":188747.544635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188749.267535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188751.049183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188752.797111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188753.564284,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":199730.04152899998,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200120.00709899998,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200167.06955699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200168.613358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200170.282007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200172.103174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200172.99799,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200202.305978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200202.64132199998,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212347.284115,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":212674.596749,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212711.22725599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":212712.965689,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212714.600256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212716.342075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212718.18547599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212719.82476999998,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224602.317626,"code":1005}]}